=   entry .gc   the garbage collector: `immix`, `commix`, `boehm` or `none`
-     detail
+     detail

-         Immix is the default; Commix its concurrent variant; Boehm the conservative
-         collector; `none` allocates without collecting.
-     entry .immix   the Immix collector (the default)
-     entry .commix   the concurrent Commix collector
-     entry .boehm   the Boehm conservative collector
-     entry .none   no garbage collection
-   entry .mode   the build mode: `debug`, `releaseFast` or `releaseFull`
+         Immix ist die Vorgabe; Commix seine nebenläufige Variante; Boehm der konservative
+         Collector; `none` alloziert, ohne einzusammeln.
+     entry .immix   der Immix-Collector (die Vorgabe)
+     entry .commix   der nebenläufige Commix-Collector
+     entry .boehm   der konservative Boehm-Collector
+     entry .none   keine Garbage Collection
+   entry .mode   der Build-Modus: `debug`, `releaseFast` oder `releaseFull`

=   entry .mode   the build mode: `debug`, `releaseFast` or `releaseFull`
-     detail
+     detail

-         `debug` is the default and quickest to link; the release modes optimise, `releaseFull`
-         most aggressively.
-     entry .debug   a debug build (the default)
-     entry .releaseFast   an optimised build, favouring link time
-     entry .releaseFull   a fully optimised build
-   entry .lto   link-time optimization: `none`, `thin` or `full`
+         `debug` ist die Vorgabe und am schnellsten gelinkt; die Release-Modi optimieren,
+         `releaseFull` am aggressivsten.
+     entry .debug   ein Debug-Build (die Vorgabe)
+     entry .releaseFast   ein optimierter Build, der die Link-Zeit bevorzugt
+     entry .releaseFull   ein vollständig optimierter Build
+   entry .lto   Link-Zeit-Optimierung: `none`, `thin` oder `full`

